{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on <strong>Everdark</strong>, an action-packed shooter that blends classics like Unreal or Doom with influences from survival horror games such as Resident Evil. Filled with references to 1980s horror movies, you'll be transported to a city swarming with <strong>vampires</strong>, where you'll face these creatures in diverse and bloody ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.poster.avif?t=1755706089\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.webm?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.mp4?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive in a devastated city</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning from a visit to your cousin in Milwaukee, you're forced to take a detour that leads you to Everdark. Then, you suffer a terrible car accident that leaves you stranded with no way to call for help or continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out is on foot. However, the streets have descended into chaos\u2026 The city is infested with vampires that have wiped out most of its inhabitants! Can you help the survivors, uncover the cause of this catastrophe, and escape alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.poster.avif?t=1755706089\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.webm?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.mp4?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frenetic first-person shooter</strong> that will take you back to the '80s with its atmosphere, references, and inspirations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic survival horror elements</strong>, including scarce resources and ammunition for your firearms, as well as puzzles that complete the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 levels full of bloodsuckers</strong>, action, exploration, and all the ingredients you could expect from a vampire story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fearsome enemies</strong> that will only die if you manage to drive a stake through their heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful arsenal of weapons</strong> that will allow you to fight against vampires with different strategies, using firearms, melee weapons, and classic vampire-slaying tools like holy water, crosses, garlic, and the favorite among experts: the wooden stake!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everdark is the first chapter</strong> of a series of video games that will take place in the same universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what happened in Everdark and put an end to the nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.poster.avif?t=1755706089\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.webm?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.mp4?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videogame developed by ESDIP_GAMES, a studio born from the latest course of &quot;Arts and Visual Development for Video Games&quot; at ESDIP_Escuela de Arte de Madrid (Spain). In their third and final year, students develop a full game that gets published on Steam and is marketed by the school.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324980?t=1755706089","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324980?t=1755706089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/a0f5c3a4f48fd48d79da5abaae61e60d8890889e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755706089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/a0f5c3a4f48fd48d79da5abaae61e60d8890889e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755706089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or inappropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on <strong>Everdark</strong>, an action-packed shooter that blends classics like Unreal or Doom with influences from survival horror games such as Resident Evil. Filled with references to 1980s horror movies, you'll be transported to a city swarming with <strong>vampires</strong>, where you'll face these creatures in diverse and bloody ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla