etic first-person shooter</strong> that will take you back to the '80s with its atmosphere, references, and inspirations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic survival horror elements</strong>, including scarce resources and ammunition for your firearms, as well as puzzles that complete the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 levels full of bloodsuckers</strong>, action, exploration, and all the ingredients you could expect from a vampire story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fearsome enemies</strong> that will only die if you manage to drive a stake through their heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful arsenal of weapons</strong> that will allow you to fight against vampires with different strategies, using firearms, melee weapons, and classic vampire-slaying tools like holy water, crosses, garlic, and the favorite among experts: the wooden stake!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everdark is the first chapter</strong> of a series of video games that will take place in the same universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what happened in Everdark and put an end to the nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.poster.avif?t=1755706089\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.webm?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.mp4?t=1755706089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videogame developed by ESDIP_GAMES, a studio born from the latest course of &quot;Arts and Visual Development for Video Games&quot; at ESDIP_Escuela de Arte de Madrid (Spain). In their third and final year, students develop a full game that gets published on Steam and is marketed by the school.</p>","developers":["ESDIP_GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/header.jpg?t=1755706089","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9ESDIP ESCUELA DE ARTE S.L., ESDIP GAMES is a registered trademark of ESDIP ESCUELA DE ARTE S.L. Published by ESDIP Escuela de Arte. Distributed by ESDIP Escuela de Arte.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185375,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185375/movie480.mp4?t=1755605032","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185375/movie_max.mp4?t=1755605032"},"name":"Everdark Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185375/6dcf5d31793f3830cb752992f798b82ac01404fe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755605032","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185375/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755605032","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185375/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755605032"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257073852,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257073852/movie480.mp4?t=1755601633","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257073852/movie_max.mp4?t=1755601633"},"name":"Everdark Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257073852/35d19499bc57b41b0ceda01dcefa1c5e15b6a015/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755601633","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257073852/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755601633","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257073852/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755601633"}}],"name":"EVERDARK: Undead Apocalypse","pa